{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23610","headline":"自思益寺次楞伽寺作 · 白居易","name":"自思益寺次楞伽寺作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝从思益峰游後，晚到楞伽寺歇时。\n照水姿容虽已老，上山筋力未全衰。\n行逢禅客多相问，坐倚渔舟一自思。\n犹去悬车十五载，休官非早亦非迟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_23610.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_23610","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}